+    * the executer never reads -> tasks after the first run on h=0/w=0 (zero output). The
+    * vendor pins group 0 every task. ROCKET_SPTR overrides (0x00 = no PP, group 0 fixed). */
+   /* Path B: single-task tiles have no next task to ping-pong to; depthwise
